# Which concept belongs to which TheZoo collection (RM-CON-01).
# Expected cost: one pass over the skos:member triples of the collections, about 6,700 rows
# (measured on Corese on 2026-11-19), a few hundred KB. No placeholder: same query for everyone.
# LIMIT is a safety net far above the real size. A full page means a truncated index, so the
# loader refuses it (it never serves a partial index). Keep it equal to MEMBERS_LIMIT in
# app/thesaurus/collections.py.
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?collection ?member WHERE {
  ?collection a skos:Collection ;
              skos:member ?member .
} LIMIT 50000
